Package: citos-plymouth-theme
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CIT-OS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/cybroidinstitute/cit-os
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: plymouth
Description: CIT-OS boot splash
 Plymouth theme that plays the CIT-OS logo's draw-in animation on the brand
 background, then holds the logo until the next program draws. Installing
 it makes it the default theme and rebuilds the initramfs.
